{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lootbane</strong> is a minimalistic RPG set in a world where loot is power, and risk is everything. Every turn brings a new encounter: peaceful grasslands, harsh steppes, volcanic wastelands, and deeper dungeons hiding rare gear and darker choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/b5d4ef624398f6fe4f72efa2db12da85.poster.avif?t=1774697719\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/b5d4ef624398f6fe4f72efa2db12da85.webm?t=1774697719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/b5d4ef624398f6fe4f72efa2db12da85.mp4?t=1774697719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple rules. Endless choices</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items are randomized, and their true power remains unknown until you extract them from a dungeon or win a fight. Every decision you make - whether to explore further, stand and fight, or retreat - turns into a high-stakes gamble where a single greedy move can cost you everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/4c81fb11a6bcd89734e33b81c7f9d5d9.poster.avif?t=1774697719\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/4c81fb11a6bcd89734e33b81c7f9d5d9.webm?t=1774697719\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/extras/4c81fb11a6bcd89734e33b81c7f9d5d9.mp4?t=1774697719\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic auto-battler</strong> - fights resolve automatically, but your build choices, equipment merges, and abilities create deep, game-breaking synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>60+ abilities</strong> - mix and match to discover explosive interactions and combos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized loot &amp; crafting</strong> - every run feels new: merge items, craft upgrades, and adapt on the fly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple heroes</strong> - four distinct starters (Warrior, Vampire, Wizard, Ranger) with different stats/abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Followers &amp; choices</strong> - recruit companions with passive perks and active abilities, choose who comes along.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4 unique zones</strong> - each with its own monsters, encounters, and mini-bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom difficulty</strong> - 1 life (hardcore), 3 lives (balanced), or unlimited lives (casual).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-progression</strong> - unlock 30+ permanent starting bonuses to expand replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Infinite replayability</strong>\u00a0- procedural encounters, randomized items, and countless synergies mean no two runs feel the same.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3950440?t=1774697719","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/71b1e2b6bf03bb950047cdfcda8b0996e2b01382/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774697719","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3950440/ce882c5999e8171ef65177b4f91413dcd71f6f51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774697719","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstat